          <!-- FOV cone, landscape. H2-frame corner = offset (0.080,0,0.12) + (depth in +X,
               ±horiz in Y, ±vert in Z). Near (dist 0.05): vert half=0.0319 -> z 0.088..0.152;
               horiz half=0.05 -> y ±0.05. Far (dist 0.60): vert half=0.3827 -> z -0.263..0.503;
